# The destination is registered with defaults rather than the source's
# layout, silently undoing a reshard.
MODULE: DestinationInheritsTopologyDefaultLayout
TARGET: DestinationInheritsTopology
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the destination is registered with the default layout
PERTURBS: BuildStep

--- FIND
    /\ LET lay == IF destReg THEN shards[dest] ELSE shards[alias] IN
--- REPLACE
    /\ LET lay == IF destReg THEN shards[dest] ELSE {1} IN
--- END
